Based on the provided text, here is the continuation and completion of the **IntarsiaML architecture plan (v0.2)**. The text cuts off at the "Language and build" table, so I will complete that table and proceed with the logical next sections (Architecture, Kernel Packs, Phasing, and Governance) consistent with the tone, constraints, and goals outlined in the prompt.

